{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>There you shall slaughter the Paschal offering.</b> Since it mentioned the firstborn, which is eaten in the Temple, it mentioned after it the Paschal offering, which is also eaten in the Temple. And since it mentioned the Paschal offering, it mentioned after it the second festival and after it also the third; but the Day of Shofar-blast and the Day of the Tenth it did not mention, because the public does not assemble in them in the Temple." "<b>In the evening.</b> I might have understood it in its plain sense. Scripture says: <b>at the time of your departure</b> — from six hours and onward. And so it says: ״ויהי בעצם היום הזה יצאו״ etc. And even though there is no proof for the matter of בין הערבים, that it is from six hours and onward, it is a reminder of the matter: ״כי פנה היום כי ינטו צללי ערב״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:00.519613807Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}